    "problems": "No recovery attacks are evaluated, and no chance-level target reference is reported. The tasks are behavior/performance proxies rather than direct measurements of whether knowledge remains encoded. The authors also note instruction-optimization limitations and manual, trial-and-error merge-weight selection.",
    "rows_left_out": "Stepwise results in Tables 7–9 and the orthogonality experiment in Table 10, plus baseline-method comparisons and data-source ablations in Tables 2–6 and 11–13, are omitted: they report unlearning trajectories, method comparisons, or utility differences, not recovery attacks. No attack-result rows are omitted because none are reported.",
    "untested": [
      {
