    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "RMU (the WMDP method) appears only as a baseline. In the stepwise tables the target metric rebounds after each retain-PEM addition (e.g., Person F1 0.0306 rising to 0.3210 in Table 8). This shows the forget effect is easily undone by adding a retain module, a loose hint at shallowness, but it is the method's own procedure, not an attack. It was not used for a verdict."
  },
